---
// Site-wide animated tagline strip, shown under the navbar on every page.
---

<div class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary dark:from-slate-900 dark:to-slate-950 overflow-hidden">
  <p
    class="tagline-bar max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-1.5 sm:py-2.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 sm:gap-2 text-center text-[9.5px] xs:text-[10.5px] sm:text-sm font-heading font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight sm:tracking-wide text-white whitespace-nowrap overflow-x-auto"
  >
    <span class="hidden sm:inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="opacity-95">10+ Tech Websites.</span>
    <span class="tagline-shimmer font-extrabold">One Smart Place to Stay Updated</span>
    <span class="hidden sm:inline-block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </p>
</div>
